precision / multiplicity duality -- sum_a mu(wa) = mu(w)
  255 words: 0 failures (exact truncated geometric sum)
  precision lost per step = a_n = log2(1 / relative child mass).

exponent identity
  h  = alpha H2(1/alpha)       = 1.5056439
  I0 = alpha (1 - H2(1/alpha)) = 0.0793186
  h + I0 = alpha               = 1.5849625
  the union bound adds 1 per confined word and so fails by 2^{h n}.

